5.       Indemnification

5.1. Employee hereby indemnifies and agrees to keep the Company indemnified, including its Affiliates and their respective directors, officers and representatives (each such person and/or entity being an “Indemnified Party”) from and against, any and all direct, indirect, or incident losses including lost revenue or potential revenue loss, claims, damages, costs including any cost escalations and expenses including all legal expenses borne by Company, as well as penalties, taxes, and liabilities, including third party claims for damages, incurred on account of:

(a)  breach or non-performance of any of the obligations of Employee set forth herein;

(b)  breach or threatened breach of Confidentiality and Non-Disclosure and/or Intellectual Property Rights obligations by Employee;

(c)any claim or proceeding brought by third party against Company in respect of gross negligence/omission owing to the Employee during his/her employment or otherwise;
